# Excluded from the Docker build context, for both images.
#
# `node_modules` matters most: the build stage installs its own, and a host copy laid on
# top would overwrite it with binaries built for a different platform. `.env` is a secret
# and has no business in an image layer, even one that is not shipped.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/

# Neither image builds the mobile app.
apps/mobile
